From 97f0e01db9b6a25cfeadcac10b1a7f0a2c0f2043 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: onedots <onedots0@outlook.com>
Date: Fri, 3 Jul 2026 23:47:58 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 2/8] board: add onedots stm32mp157c-512d board support

---
